<title>USA: Derma Sciences CFO resigns.</title>
<headline>Derma Sciences CFO resigns.</headline>
<dateline>PRINCETON, N.J. 1997-05-30</dateline>
<text>
<p>Derma Sciences Inc said Friday its chief financial officer, Gary Borthwick, had resigned and would leave the company, effective July 1, to pursue other opportunities.</p>
<p>Derma said it will immediately initiate a search for a successor.</p>
<p>Derma said Borthwick will serve the company in a consultative capacity through December 1997 to assure a smooth transition to his successor.</p>
</text>
